<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1F">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "06">
<configtype typenbr = "2">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1626018" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Heater Shut Off Valve Removal and Installation
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1626018001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect negative (–) cable at battery.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drain coolant. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1626004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Hoist vehicle and remove engine undercover.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect heater shut off valve connector (1).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect heater hose No.1 (2) and No.2 (3) from heater shut off valve (4).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove heater shut off valve.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove heater shut off valve bracket, if necessary.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "ILSB0A162031.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "58.169mm" ver = "01" gw = "187" gh = "148"/>
</figure>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1626018002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
<intxrefpoff refid = "AENLSB0A1626021">Heater Shut Off Valve Inspection:K14D</intxrefpoff>
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Reverse removal procedure noting the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
If there is matchmark on each of hose and heater shut off valve, install the hose aligning matchmark on hose with matchmark on heater shut off valve and then set each clamp to the original position.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Refill cooling system with coolant. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1626005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Check cooling system for leakage. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1626003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</servinfosub>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
